--Description: 8)  Determine which TCGA projects in the older RNA-seq snapshot
--RNASEQ_HG38_GDC_R28 contain any of the four downstream genes (MDM2, TP53,
--CDKN1A, CCNE1).  Listing distinct “project_short_name” values first tells us
